  "description": "From the first page: \"Michigan Consolidated Gas Company presents to you a creative collection of recipes using Michigan's abundant products. Michigan's network of lakes, rich farmlands and active industries produce much of the country's food supply. We have incorporated these foods into native Michigan recipes and imaginative new ideas for your holiday use. We hope these recipes will add to your enjoyment of the Christmas season in Michigan and we wish you a peaceful and joyous year to come.\" As indicated in the intro, this is a booklet of recipes put out by Michigan Consolidated Gas Company for the 1976 holiday season.",
